        <mxCell id="mlops-note" value="&lt;b&gt;ML-Ops Data Sources:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. EventBus: Proto events (via Redis Streams)&lt;br&gt;2. TimescaleDB: Historical data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;NOTE: ML-Ops gets ALL real-time data through EventBus (post data-staging), never raw Redis" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e6f3ff;strokeColor=#4A90D9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
